<title>USA: TABLE-MedQuist Inc Q2 shr rises to $0.24.</title>
<headline>TABLE-MedQuist Inc Q2 shr rises to $0.24.</headline>
<dateline>MARLTON, N.J. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.24		    $0.03</p>
<p> Net			  1,792			835</p>
<p> Revs			20,189		   14,373</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,458		    5,238</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS months ended June 30</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.46		    $0.17</p>
<p> Net			  3,427		    1,382</p>
<p> Revs			38,810		   28,351</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,432		    4,642</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: The above 1996 figures exclude $707,000, or $0.13 per share, of a non-recurring inducement deduction recorded in the second quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>Before the deduction, the company's earning per share in the 1996 quarter wass $0.16 and $0.30 in the six month period.</p>
